    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your Shooting phase, right after a **BRÔKHYR**, **IRONKIN STEELJACKS** or **ARKANYST EVALUATOR** unit of yours has shot; that unit is the target.\n\nPick 1 enemy unit (not **MONSTERS** or **VEHICLES**) hit by at least one of those attacks. Until your next Shooting phase starts, whenever the chosen enemy unit moves with a Normal, Fall Back or **Advance move**:\n\n- Roll a D6 for every model in it.\n- Each 1 inflicts 1 **mortal wound** on it, up to 6 each time.",
